<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ausdrill yr net profit jumps 47 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ausdrill yr net profit jumps 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.10 vs 7.94</p>
<p>    Net					8.37 vs 5.69</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.50 vs 7.00</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     8.00 vs 7.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  129.89 vs 105.76</p>
<p>    Other income			   6.09 vs 3.04</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   15.48 vs 11.28</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 0.54</p>
<p>Dividend is 10 percent franked  </p>
<p>Pay date Dec 5</p>
<p>Reg date to be announced.</p>
<p>    Tax					4.74 vs 1.72</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.15 vs 2.57</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   9.97 vs 8.12</p>
<p>NOTE: Ausdrill ltd is a drilling contractor.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
